## Pre-checks

1. Confirm prerequisite waves and all listed dependencies are available.
2. Confirm named business and technical owners are on the cutover bridge.
3. Confirm backups, monitoring, access, and the rollback decision maker.
4. Review TSA, licence, data protection, and wave conflict records.

